    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾰδι-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδιον</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a stade long, deep</i>, or
				<i>high</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. βάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					34.11.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ς. δρόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					7.73
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυραμίδες σταδιαῖαι τὸ ὕψος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					1.52
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διφθέραι ς. τοῖς μεγέθεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					12.539c
				</span></i>
			:—v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταδαῖος</span>.</div>
